WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
I wasn’t quite hysterical.

2
00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:10.780
I think the first thing I was called is a meddlesome housewife, and I kind of liked it, because that’s what I was.

3
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:21.600
I was a housewife, I had a baby on my hip, and I was certainly going to meddle if they were going to meddle with me,

4
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:27.900
which is, you know, trying to convince me that garbage in my drinking water was good for me.
